  <h2 id="checkpoint">Use The 4-Checkpoint Protocol before you commit to this path</h2>

  <p>
    A single salary figure, or one relative's opinion about "BAMS being a safe medical degree," cannot tell you
    whether this path genuinely fits your specific situation. The 4-Checkpoint Protocol narrows the decision to
    what actually matters for you.
  </p>

