  </div>

  <h2 id="gates">Pass The 3 Gates before you commit real years to this path</h2>

  <p>
    The 4-Checkpoint Protocol tells you whether BAMS fits on paper. The 3 Gates make you test it in the real world
    before you spend 5.5 years and a real education budget finding out the hard way.
